const nav=[['dashboard','Overview','▣'],['calendar','PM calendar','▦'],['workOrders','Work orders','▤'],['plans','PM schedules','↻'],['assets','Asset register','◈'],['locations','Locations','⌂'],['people','Teams','♙'],['parts','Inventory','▥'],['financeReports','Finances','¤'],['audit','Audit trail','≡'],['inspections','Compliance','☑'],['readings','Meter readings','◫'],['reports','Reports','▤'],['media','Media library','▧'],['users','Technicians','♙'],['setup','System setup','⚙'],['company','Company details','▣'],['settings','Settings & backup','⚙'],['help','User manual','?']];
const financePages=['financeReports','financeRequisitions','financePurchaseOrders','financeVendors','financeCosts'];const financeLabels=[['financeReports','Financial reports'],['financeRequisitions','Stores requisitions'],['financePurchaseOrders','Vendor purchase orders'],['financeVendors','Vendor register'],['financeCosts','Additional work-order costs']];
const app=document.getElementById('app');let state=initialState(),view='dashboard',search='',calendarMonth=today().slice(0,7),filter='All',modal=null,saving=false,cloudReady=false,cloudUser='',saveTimer=null,banner='',serverMode=false,serverRevision=0,currentUser=null,serverStatus=null,reportPerson='',reportFrom='',reportTo='',reportBasis='completed',financeBusy=false,financeFrom='',financeTo='',mediaType='assets',mediaRecord='';
const esc=x=>String(x??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
function optionList(type){const col={asset:'assets',location:'locations',person:'people'}[type];return col?state[col]:[];}
function friendly(field,val){if(val===undefined||val===null||val==='')return '—';if(['assetId','locationId','assigneeId','parentId'].includes(field)){const col=field==='assetId'?'assets':field==='assigneeId'?'people':'locations';const item=state[col].find(x=>x.id===val);return item?.name||val||'—';}if(typeof val==='boolean')return val?'Yes':'No';return String(val);}
function kindClass(x){return String(x||'').toLowerCase().replace(/\s+/g,'-');}
function badge(x){return `<span class="pill ${kindClass(x)}">${esc(x||'—')}</span>`;}
function toast(message,error=false){banner=message;render();if(error)console.error(message);}
function statusbar(){if(serverMode)return `<div class="sync"><span class="dot online"></span>MariaDB · ${esc(currentUser?.username||'')} (${esc(currentUser?.role||'')})</div>`;return `<div class="sync"><span class="dot ${cloudReady?'online':'offline'}"></span>${cloudReady?`Puter cloud · ${esc(cloudUser)}`:'Local session · connect Puter for persistent storage'}</div>`;}
function shell(body){const m=metrics(state);const item=nav.find(x=>x[0]===view)||financeLabels.find(x=>x[0]===view);app.innerHTML=`<div class="layout"><aside class="sidebar"><div class="brand"><div class="brand-mark">✳</div><div><strong>CMMS</strong><small>HOSPITALITY OPERATIONS</small></div></div><div class="site-chip"><span>PROPERTY</span><strong>${esc(state.settings.facility)}</strong></div><nav>${nav.map(([key,label,ico])=>`<button class="nav-item ${view===key?'active':''}" data-nav="${key}"><span class="nav-icon">${ico}</span>${label}${key==='workOrders'&&m.overdue?`<em>${m.overdue}</em>`:''}</button>${key==='financeReports'?`<div class="finance-subnav">${financeLabels.map(([id,label])=>`<button class="nav-item finance-child ${view===id?'active':''}" data-nav="${id}">${esc(label)}</button>`).join('')}</div>`:''}`).join('')}</nav><div class="sidebar-bottom"><a href="https://developer.puter.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Powered by Puter ↗</a><span>Version 1.0 · ZAR / SAST</span></div></aside><div class="main"><header class="topbar"><div class="breadcrumbs">OPERATIONS <span>/</span> <b>${esc(item?.[1]||'Overview')}</b></div><div class="top-actions">${statusbar()}${serverMode?'<button class="btn outline" id="logoutButton">Sign out</button>':`<button class="btn outline" id="cloudButton">${cloudReady?'Sync now':'Connect Puter'}</button>`}<button class="menu-toggle" id="menuButton" aria-label="Open navigation">☰</button></div></header><main class="content">${banner?`<div class="notice">${esc(banner)} <button data-dismiss="1" aria-label="Dismiss">×</button></div>`:''}${body}</main><footer class="footer">Hospitality CMMS · Maintenance planning and records <span>·</span> <a href="https://developer.puter.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Powered by Puter</a></footer></div></div>${modal?modalHtml():''}`;wire();}
function heading(title,subtitle,action=''){return `<div class="page-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">FACILITY MAINTENANCE SYSTEM</div><h1>${title}</h1><p>${subtitle}</p></div>${action}</div>`;}
function metricCard(label,value,detail,icon,accent=''){return `<div class="metric ${accent}"><div class="metric-top"><span>${label}</span><span class="metric-icon">${icon}</span></div><strong>${value}</strong><small>${detail}</small></div>`;}
function dashboard(){const m=metrics(state),now=today(),upcoming=calendarItems(state,now,addDays(now,30)).slice(0,9),recent=[...state.workOrders].sort((a,b)=>(b.createdAt||'').localeCompare(a.createdAt||'')).slice(0,7);return heading('Facility overview','Operational performance and preventive maintenance at a glance.',`<button class="btn primary" data-new="workOrders">+ New work order</button>`)+`<div class="metrics">${metricCard('REGISTERED ASSETS',m.assets,'Equipment in asset register','◈')}${metricCard('OPEN WORK ORDERS',m.open,'Awaiting completion','▤')}${metricCard('OVERDUE JOBS',m.overdue,'Immediate follow-up','!',m.overdue?'danger':'')}${metricCard('ACTIVE PM PLANS',m.plans,'Recurring maintenance','↻')}</div><div class="two-col"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Upcoming maintenance</h2><p>Next 30 days · scheduled and issued work</p></div><button class="link-btn" data-nav="calendar">Full calendar →</button></div>${upcoming.length?`<div class="event-list">${upcoming.map(e=>`<div class="event-row"><div class="date-tile"><strong>${e.date.slice(-2)}</strong><span>${new Date(e.date+'T12:00:00').toLocaleString('en-ZA',{month:'short'})}</span></div><div class="event-main"><strong>${esc(e.title)}</strong><small>${esc(friendly('assetId',e.assetId))} · ${e.kind==='pm'?'Scheduled PM':'Work order'}</small></div>${e.kind==='pm'?`<button class="btn tiny" data-issue="${e.id}" data-date="${e.date}">Issue</button>`:badge(e.status)}</div>`).join('')}</div>`:'<div class="empty">No maintenance due in the next 30 days. Create a PM plan to populate the calendar.</div>'}</section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Workload priorities</h2><p>Current maintenance backlog</p></div></div><div class="priority-block">${PRIORITIES.map(pr=>{const count=state.workOrders.filter(w=>w.priority===pr&&!['Completed','Cancelled'].includes(w.status)).length;return `<div class="priority-line"><div>${badge(pr)}<span>${count} open</span></div><div class="progress"><i style="width:${m.open?100*count/m.open:0}%"></i></div></div>`;}).join('')}</div><div class="section-note">${m.stockAlerts} inventory items at or below reorder level · ${state.inspections.filter(x=>x.nextDueDate&&x.nextDueDate<now).length} overdue compliance records</div></section></div><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><div><h2>Recent work orders</h2><p>Latest maintenance activity</p></div><button class="link-btn" data-nav="workOrders">View all →</button></div>${table('workOrders',recent)}</section>`;}
function table(collection,rows){const conf=SCHEMA[collection];if(!rows.length)return '<div class="empty">No records yet. Use the New button to create your first record.</div>';return `<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr>${conf.columns.map(c=>`<th>${esc(conf.fields.find(f=>f[0]===c)?.[1]||c.replace(/[A-Z]/g,m=>' '+m).toUpperCase())}</th>`).join('')}<th>ACTIONS</th></tr></thead><tbody>${rows.map(item=>`<tr>${conf.columns.map(col=>`<td>${['priority','criticality','status','result'].includes(col)?badge(friendly(col,item[col])):esc(friendly(col,item[col]))}</td>`).join('')}<td><button class="text-button" data-edit="${collection}" data-id="${item.id}">Edit</button> ${collection==='workOrders'?`<button class="text-button" data-detail="${item.id}">Details</button> <button class="text-button" data-print-order="${esc(item.id)}">Print</button> <button class="text-button" data-req-order="${esc(item.id)}">Stores requisition</button>`:collection==='assets'?`<button class="text-button" data-print-asset="${esc(item.id)}">QR label</button>`:''}</td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div>`;}
function collectionView(col){const conf=SCHEMA[col];let records=state[col].filter(r=>JSON.stringify(r).toLowerCase().includes(search.toLowerCase()));if(filter!=='All'&&col==='workOrders')records=records.filter(r=>r.status===filter);if(col==='workOrders')records.sort((a,b)=>(a.dueDate||'9999').localeCompare(b.dueDate||'9999'));return heading(conf.label,`${state[col].length} records · Search and maintain all ${conf.label.toLowerCase()}.`,`<button class="btn primary" data-new="${col}">+ New ${col==='plans'?'PM plan':'record'}</button>`)+`<section class="panel"><div class="toolbar"><input id="searchInput" class="search" placeholder="Search ${esc(conf.label.toLowerCase())}..." value="${esc(search)}" aria-label="Search records">${col==='workOrders'?`<select id="statusFilter">${['All',...STATUSES].map(s=>`<option ${filter===s?'selected':''}>${s}</option>`).join('')}</select>`:''}<button class="btn outline" data-export="${col}">Export CSV</button></div>${table(col,records)}</section>`;}
function calendar(){const {start,end}=monthBounds(calendarMonth),items=calendarItems(state,addDays(start,-7),addDays(end,7));const first=new Date(start+'T12:00:00');const offset=(first.getDay()+6)%7;const cells=Array.from({length:42},(_,i)=>addDays(start,i-offset));const visible=items.filter(x=>x.date>=cells[0]&&x.date<=cells[41]);const name=first.toLocaleString('en-ZA',{month:'long',year:'numeric'});return heading('Preventive maintenance calendar','Visualise recurring PM, issue scheduled work and monitor due dates.',`<button class="btn primary" data-new="plans">+ Create PM plan</button>`)+`<section class="panel calendar-panel"><div class="calendar-controls"><div><button class="btn outline" data-month="-1">←</button><button class="btn outline" data-month="0">Today</button><button class="btn outline" data-month="1">→</button></div><h2>${name}</h2><div class="legend"><span><i class="legend-dot pm"></i> PM scheduled</span><span><i class="legend-dot issued"></i> Issued order</span></div></div><div class="calendar-grid">${['Mon','Tue','Wed','Thu','Fri','Sat','Sun'].map(d=>`<div class="cal-dayname">${d}</div>`).join('')}${cells.map(date=>{const dayItems=visible.filter(x=>x.date===date);return `<div class="cal-cell ${date.slice(0,7)===calendarMonth?'':'muted'} ${date===today()?'current':''}"><span class="cal-number">${Number(date.slice(-2))}</span>${dayItems.slice(0,4).map(e=>`<button class="cal-event ${e.kind==='pm'?'pm':'issued'}" ${e.kind==='pm'?`data-issue="${e.id}" data-date="${date}"`:`data-detail="${e.id}"`} title="${esc(e.title)}">${e.kind==='pm'?'↻':'▤'} ${esc(e.title)}</button>`).join('')}${dayItems.length>4?`<small>+${dayItems.length-4} more</small>`:''}</div>`;}).join('')}</div><p class="calendar-help">Select a blue PM occurrence to issue a work order. Select an issued order to review its completion details. Monthly and annual scheduling is anchored to the start date.</p></section>`;}
function reports(){const m=metrics(state),monthly=Array.from({length:6},(_,i)=>{const d=new Date();d.setDate(1);d.setMonth(d.getMonth()-(5-i));return today(d).slice(0,7);});return heading('Maintenance reports','Analyse performance, spending, compliance and exports.',`<button class="btn outline" data-export="workOrders">Download work orders CSV</button>`)+technicianReportView()+`<div class="metrics">${metricCard('COMPLETED',m.completed,'Total closed work','✓')}${metricCard('PREVENTIVE DONE',m.pmCompleted,'Closed PM orders','↻')}${metricCard('BACKLOG',m.open,'Non-completed orders','▤')}${metricCard('INVENTORY ALERTS',m.stockAlerts,'Reorder attention','!')}</div><div class="two-col"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Six-month completion trend</h2></div><div class="bar-chart">${monthly.map(month=>{const count=state.workOrders.filter(w=>w.completedAt?.slice(0,7)===month).length;const max=Math.max(1,...monthly.map(x=>state.workOrders.filter(w=>w.completedAt?.slice(0,7)===x).length));return `<div class="bar-col"><strong>${count}</strong><div class="bar-track"><div style="height:${Math.max(count?6:0,(count/max)*100)}%"></div></div><small>${month.slice(5)}</small></div>`;}).join('')}</div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Maintenance costs</h2></div><div class="cost-row"><span>Recorded material cost</span><strong>R ${state.workOrders.reduce((n,w)=>n+(Number(w.materialCost)||0),0).toLocaleString('en-ZA',{minimumFractionDigits:2})}</strong></div><div class="cost-row"><span>Recorded labour hours</span><strong>${state.workOrders.reduce((n,w)=>n+(Number(w.laborHours)||0),0).toFixed(1)} h</strong></div><div class="cost-row"><span>Asset register count</span><strong>${m.assets}</strong></div><p class="section-note">Costs are based on entered records, not supplier invoices or payroll integrations.</p></section></div><section class="panel"><div class="panel-head"><h2>Data exports</h2><p>Independent CSV extracts for analysis and handover</p></div><div class="export-grid">${MODULES.map(c=>`<button class="btn outline" data-export="${c}">↓ ${SCHEMA[c].label}</button>`).join('')}</div></section>`;}
function settingsView(){return heading('Settings & backup','Configure your facility, connect storage and control your records.')+`<div class="two-col"><section class="panel pad"><h2>Facility details</h2><form id="settingsForm"><label>Facility name<input name="facility" required value="${esc(state.settings.facility)}"></label><label>Site code<input name="siteCode" value="${esc(state.settings.siteCode)}"></label><label>Currency<select name="currency"><option selected value="ZAR">ZAR · South African rand</option></select></label><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Save settings</button></form></section><section class="panel pad"><h2>Cloud account</h2><p>${cloudReady?`Signed in to Puter as <b>${esc(cloudUser)}</b>. Records are stored in this account's app-specific data store.`:'You are currently working in a temporary local browser session. Connect Puter to persist changes across sessions.'}</p><button class="btn primary" id="settingsCloud">${cloudReady?'Sync to Puter':'Connect Puter account'}</button><p class="fine-print">This release is single-account by design. Puter sign-in is not a multi-user role management system.</p></section></div><section class="panel pad"><h2>Backup and recovery</h2><p>Export a full JSON snapshot before major changes. Restore replaces the current dataset after confirmation.</p><div class="button-row"><button class="btn outline" id="downloadBackup">↓ Download full backup</button><button class="btn outline" id="importBackup">↑ Restore JSON backup</button><input id="importFile" type="file" accept="application/json,.json" hidden><button class="btn outline" id="seedDemo">Load demo dataset</button></div><p class="fine-print">Demo loading and restore overwrite all current records. Export a backup first. Data is not automatically copied to your GitHub repository.</p></section>`;}
function helpView(){return heading('User manual','Complete operating instructions and deployment reference.',`<a class="btn primary" href="./USER_MANUAL.md" target="_blank">Open full manual ↗</a>`)+`<section class="panel pad manual"><h2>Quick start</h2><ol><li>Use <b>Connect Puter</b> to sign in and enable cloud persistence.</li><li>Set the facility name under <b>Settings & backup</b>.</li><li>Create locations, people/teams, and equipment assets.</li><li>Create preventive maintenance plans with a start date, frequency, assigned team and checklist.</li><li>Open the PM calendar and click a blue occurrence to issue its work order.</li><li>Complete checklist items, record findings and labour/material costs, then close the work order.</li><li>Review overdue work and export reports as CSV. Export a full JSON backup regularly.</li></ol><h2>Important limitations</h2><p>Scheduled PM occurrences are calculated when viewed; work orders are not issued automatically by a server. Cloud storage is per signed-in Puter account. Sharing a link does not share a maintenance database. Critical inspections, legally prescribed maintenance and sign-offs must follow approved procedures and competent-person requirements.</p><h2>Need detailed guidance?</h2><p>See <a href="./USER_MANUAL.md" target="_blank">USER_MANUAL.md</a> for all modules, operating procedures, import/backup, deployment, security, limitations and troubleshooting.</p></section>`;}
function fieldHtml([key,label,type='text',required],row){const value=row[key]??(key==='active'?true:key==='interval'?1:key==='priority'?'Medium':key==='status'?'Open':key==='frequency'?'Monthly':key==='quantity'||key==='reorderLevel'||key==='unitCost'||key==='materialCost'||key==='laborHours'?0:key==='startDate'?today():'');const req=required?'required':'';if(type==='checkbox')return `<label class="check-label"><input name="${key}" type="checkbox" ${value?'checked':''}> ${esc(label)}</label>`;if(type==='textarea')return `<label>${esc(label)}<textarea name="${key}" rows="3">${esc(value)}</textarea></label>`;if(type.startsWith('select:'))return `<label>${esc(label)}<select name="${key}"><option value="">Choose...</option>${type.slice(7).split('|').map(option=>`<option value="${esc(option)}" ${option===value?'selected':''}>${esc(option)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label>`;if(['asset','person','location'].includes(type))return `<label>${esc(label)}<select name="${key}"><option value="">${type==='person'?'Unassigned':'None'}</option>${optionList(type).filter(opt=>opt.id!==row.id).map(opt=>`<option value="${esc(opt.id)}" ${opt.id===value?'selected':''}>${esc(opt.name)}${opt.trade?' · '+esc(opt.trade):''}${opt.code?' · '+esc(opt.code):''}</option>`).join('')}</select>${type==='person'?'<small>Select a named technician from People & teams; the technician login must be linked to that same person record.</small>':''}</label>`;return `<label>${esc(label)}<input name="${key}" type="${type}" ${req} ${type==='number'?'step="any" min="0"':''} value="${esc(value)}"></label>`;}
function modalHtml(){if(modal.type==='detail'){const w=state.workOrders.find(x=>x.id===modal.id);if(!w)return '';return `<div class="overlay" id="overlay"><div class="dialog wide"><div class="dialog-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">${esc(w.code||'WORK ORDER')}</span><h2>${esc(w.title)}</h2></div><button class="icon-button" data-close="1">×</button></div><div class="dialog-body"><div class="detail-grid"><div><span>Status</span>${badge(w.status)}</div><div><span>Priority</span>${badge(w.priority)}</div><div><span>Due</span><strong>${esc(w.dueDate||'Not set')}</strong></div><div><span>Assigned to</span><strong>${esc(friendly('assigneeId',w.assigneeId))}</strong></div></div><p class="description">${esc(w.description||'No instructions recorded')}</p><h3>Work checklist</h3>${(w.checklist||[]).length?`<div class="checklist">${w.checklist.map((x,i)=>`<label><input type="checkbox" data-check="${i}" ${x.done?'checked':''}>${esc(x.label)}</label>`).join('')}</div>`:'<p>No checklist linked to this work order.</p>'}<label>Completion notes<textarea id="detailNotes" rows="3">${esc(w.completionNotes||'')}</textarea></label>${modal.showRequisition?requisitionForm(state,w.id):''}<div class="detail-footer"><button class="btn outline" data-edit="workOrders" data-id="${w.id}">Edit record</button><button class="btn outline" data-print-order="${esc(w.id)}">Print / reprint</button><button class="btn outline" data-req-order="${esc(w.id)}">Request spares</button>${w.status!=='Completed'&&w.status!=='Cancelled'?`<button class="btn primary" id="completeOrder">Mark completed</button>`:''}</div></div></div></div>`;}
 const col=modal.collection,conf=SCHEMA[col],row=modal.id?state[col].find(x=>x.id===modal.id):{};return `<div class="overlay" id="overlay"><div class="dialog"><div class="dialog-head"><div><span class="eyebrow">${esc(conf.label)}</span><h2>${modal.id?'Edit':'New'} ${col==='plans'?'maintenance plan':'record'}</h2></div><button class="icon-button" data-close="1">×</button></div><form id="recordForm" class="dialog-body"><div class="form-grid">${conf.fields.map(f=>fieldHtml(f,row||{})).join('')}</div><div class="dialog-actions">${modal.id?`<button class="btn danger-outline" type="button" id="deleteRecord">Delete</button>`:''}<button class="btn outline" type="button" data-close="1">Cancel</button><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Save record</button>${col==='workOrders'?'<button class="btn outline" type="submit" name="saveAction" value="print">Save &amp; print</button>':''}</div></form></div></div>`;}
function persist(){state.lastUpdated=new Date().toISOString();if(serverMode){clearTimeout(saveTimer);saveTimer=setTimeout(saveServer,350);return;}if(!cloudReady)return;clearTimeout(saveTimer);saveTimer=setTimeout(async()=>{try{saving=true;await puter.kv.set('cmms-state-v1',state);}catch(e){banner=`Cloud save failed: ${e.message}. Download a backup.`;render();}finally{saving=false;}},500);}
async function connectCloud(){if(typeof puter==='undefined'){toast('Puter.js is unavailable. Check internet connection or content blockers.',true);return;}try{if(!puter.auth.isSignedIn())await puter.auth.signIn();const user=await puter.auth.getUser();const remote=await puter.kv.get('cmms-state-v1');if(remote){const parsed=typeof remote==='string'?JSON.parse(remote):remote;const normalized=normalizeState(parsed);if(state.assets.length||state.workOrders.length||state.plans.length){if(!confirm('Cloud data exists. Load cloud records and replace this local session? Cancel to keep local data and avoid overwriting cloud.'))return;}state=normalized;}cloudUser=user?.username||user?.email||'Puter user';cloudReady=true;banner='Puter cloud connected successfully.';if(!remote)persist();render();}catch(err){toast(`Puter connection failed: ${err.message||err}`,true);}}
function download(name,text,mime){const blob=new Blob([text],{type:mime});const url=URL.createObjectURL(blob),a=document.createElement('a');a.href=url;a.download=name;a.click();setTimeout(()=>URL.revokeObjectURL(url),2000);}
function openNew(col,id=null){if(serverMode&&currentUser?.role==='technician'&&(col!=='workOrders'||!id||!state.workOrders.some(w=>w.id===id&&w.assigneeId===currentUser.personId))){toast('You can edit only your assigned work orders.',true);return;}modal={type:'form',collection:col,id};render();}
function clearFieldErrors(form){form.querySelectorAll('.field-error').forEach(el=>el.remove());form.querySelectorAll('[aria-invalid]').forEach(el=>el.removeAttribute('aria-invalid'));}
function showFieldErrors(form,errors){clearFieldErrors(form);let first=null;for(const issue of errors){const control=form.elements.namedItem(issue.field);if(!control||!control.closest)continue;const label=control.closest('label');if(!label)continue;control.setAttribute('aria-invalid','true');const note=document.createElement('small');note.className='field-error';note.setAttribute('role','alert');note.textContent=issue.message;label.append(note);first??=control;}first?.focus();if(!first)showError(Error(errors.map(x=>x.message).join(' ')),'Validate record');}
async function saveRecord(e){e.preventDefault();const printAfterSave=e.submitter?.value==='print';if(serverMode&&currentUser?.role==='technician'){const target=state.workOrders.find(w=>w.id===modal?.id);if(modal?.collection!=='workOrders'||!target||target.assigneeId!==currentUser.personId){alert('Not authorized');return;}}const col=modal.collection,form=e.currentTarget,values=new FormData(form),row=modal.id?structuredClone(state[col].find(r=>r.id===modal.id)):{id:uid()};clearFieldErrors(form);for(const [key,,type='text'] of SCHEMA[col].fields){if(type==='checkbox')row[key]=form.elements.namedItem(key).checked;else if(type==='number')row[key]=Number(values.get(key)||0);else row[key]=String(values.get(key)||'').trim();}try{for(const [key,label,,required] of SCHEMA[col].fields)if(required)requireText(row[key],label);const issues=validateRecord(col,row,state,modal.id);if(issues.length){showFieldErrors(form,issues);return;}if(col==='plans'&&(!PLAN_FREQUENCIES.includes(row.frequency)||row.interval<1||row.interval>365))throw Error('Choose a valid frequency and interval (1–365)');if(col==='plans'&&row.endDate&&row.endDate<row.startDate)throw Error('PM end date must not precede the start date');if(col==='locations'&&row.parentId===row.id)throw Error('Location cannot be its own parent');if(col==='workOrders'){if(!modal.id){Object.assign(row,newWorkOrder({...row,id:row.id}));}else if(row.status==='Completed'&&!row.completedAt){completeOrder(row,true);}}if(!modal.id)state[col].push(row);else state[col][state[col].findIndex(r=>r.id===modal.id)]=row;audit(state,modal.id?'Updated':'Created',col,row);modal=null;persist();if(printAfterSave&&col==='workOrders'){const printTab=window.open('','_blank');if(printTab){printTab.document.write('<title>Preparing work order</title><p>Saving work order before printing…</p>');}clearTimeout(saveTimer);try{if(serverMode)await saveServer(true);else if(cloudReady){await puter.kv.set('cmms-state-v1',state);}printWorkOrder(row.id,printTab);}catch(saveError){printTab?.close();banner='Work order created locally but could not be confirmed saved. Printing cancelled. '+saveError.message;render();return;}}banner='Record saved successfully.';render();}catch(error){showError(error,'Save '+SCHEMA[col].label);}}
function delRecord(){if(serverMode&&currentUser?.role!=='admin'){toast('Administrator access required.',true);return;}const col=modal.collection,row=state[col].find(r=>r.id===modal.id);if(!row||!confirm(`Delete ${row.title||row.name||row.code||'this record'}? This action cannot be undone.`))return;const deps={assets:['workOrders','plans','inspections','readings'],locations:['assets','workOrders','plans','inspections','locations'],people:['workOrders','plans'],plans:['workOrders']};if((deps[col]||[]).some(name=>state[name].some(r=>(r.assetId===row.id||r.locationId===row.id||r.parentId===row.id||r.assigneeId===row.id||r.planId===row.id)))){alert('This record has linked records. Remove or reassign references before deleting.');return;}state[col]=state[col].filter(r=>r.id!==row.id);audit(state,'Deleted',col,row);modal=null;persist();banner='Record deleted.';render();}
function issue(id,date){if(serverMode&&currentUser?.role!=='admin'){toast('Administrator access required.',true);return;}const plan=state.plans.find(p=>p.id===id);if(!plan)return;try{const existed=state.workOrders.some(w=>w.planId===id&&w.scheduledDate===date),order=materializePm(state,plan,date);if(!existed){audit(state,'Issued PM','workOrders',order);persist();}modal={type:'detail',id:order.id};banner=existed?'Existing PM work order opened.':'PM work order issued.';render();}catch(e){toast(e.message,true);}}
function navTo(v){if(serverMode&&currentUser?.role!=='admin'&&(['users','setup','company','settings','media','audit'].includes(v)||financePages.includes(v)&&!Object.values(currentUser?.permissions||{}).some(Boolean))){toast('Administrator access required.',true);return;}view=v;search='';filter='All';modal=null;banner='';render();}
function render(){if(serverStatus?.database&&!currentUser){app.innerHTML=loginScreen();wireLogin();return;}if(serverMode&&currentUser?.role!=='admin'&&(['users','setup','company','settings','media','audit'].includes(view)||financePages.includes(view)&&!Object.values(currentUser?.permissions||{}).some(Boolean)))view='dashboard';const body=view==='dashboard'?dashboard():view==='calendar'?calendar():view==='reports'?reports():financePages.includes(view)?financeView(state,financeFrom,financeTo,view):view==='audit'?auditView():view==='media'?mediaView():view==='users'?usersView():view==='setup'?setupView():view==='company'?companyView():view==='settings'?settingsView():view==='help'?helpView():collectionView(view);shell(body);}
function wire(){if(view==='audit')void loadAudit();if(financePages.includes(view)||(view==='workOrders'&&modal?.type==='detail'))wireFinance(state,{refresh:render,error:showError,range:(from,to)=>{financeFrom=from;financeTo=to;render();},create:async data=>{await api('/api/procurement/create',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(data)});await loadServer();},workflow:async data=>{await api('/api/procurement/action',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({...data,revision:serverRevision})});await loadServer();},quotes:async id=>{const result=await api('/api/files?type=quotes&id='+encodeURIComponent(id));const list=result.files.map(f=>f.name+' ('+f.id+')').join('\n')||'No quotations attached';const choice=window.confirm('Quotations:\n'+list+'\n\nOK: upload quotation. Cancel: view attachment.');if(choice){const input=document.createElement('input');input.type='file';input.accept='.pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.webp';input.onchange=async()=>{const file=input.files?.[0];if(!file)return;try{await api('/api/files?type=quotes&id='+encodeURIComponent(id)+'&name='+encodeURIComponent(file.name),{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':file.type},body:file});toast('Quotation uploaded');}catch(error){showError(error,'Quotation upload');}};input.click();}else if(result.files.length){const selected=window.prompt('Enter quotation file ID to open:\n'+list,result.files[0].id);if(selected&&result.files.some(f=>f.id===selected))window.open('/api/files/'+encodeURIComponent(selected),'_blank');}},csv:(name,rows)=>download(name+'-'+today()+'.csv',toCsv(rows),'text/csv;charset=utf-8'),transact:async mutate=>{if(financeBusy)throw Error('Another financial transaction is being saved');financeBusy=true;const before=structuredClone(state);try{mutate();if(serverMode){clearTimeout(saveTimer);await saveServer(true);}else if(cloudReady){await puter.kv.set('cmms-state-v1',state);}else throw Error('Connect persistent storage before posting financial transactions');}catch(error){state=before;throw error;}finally{financeBusy=false;}}});document.querySelectorAll('[data-nav]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>navTo(b.dataset.nav)));document.querySelectorAll('[data-new]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>openNew(b.dataset.new)));document.querySelectorAll('[data-edit]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>openNew(b.dataset.edit,b.dataset.id)));document.querySelectorAll('[data-detail]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{modal={type:'detail',id:b.dataset.detail};render();}));document.querySelectorAll('[data-req-order]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{const id=b.dataset.reqOrder;if(view==='workOrders'&&modal?.type==='detail'){modal={type:'detail',id,showRequisition:true};render();return;}navTo('financeRequisitions');const form=document.getElementById('finReq');if(form){form.elements.workOrderId.value=id;form.scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth',block:'start'});}}));document.querySelectorAll('[data-print-order]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>printWorkOrder(b.dataset.printOrder)));document.querySelectorAll('[data-print-id]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>printTechnicianCard(b.dataset.printId)));document.querySelectorAll('[data-print-asset]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>printAssetLabel(b.dataset.printAsset)));document.querySelectorAll('[data-issue]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>issue(b.dataset.issue,b.dataset.date)));document.querySelectorAll('[data-close]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{modal=null;render();}));document.querySelectorAll('[data-dismiss]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{banner='';render();}));document.querySelectorAll('[data-export]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>download(`cmms-${b.dataset.export}-${today()}.csv`,toCsv(state[b.dataset.export]),'text/csv;charset=utf-8')));
 document.getElementById('logoutButton')?.addEventListener('click',async()=>{await api('/api/logout',{method:'POST'});currentUser=null;render();});document.getElementById('reportPerson')?.addEventListener('change',e=>{reportPerson=e.target.value;render();});document.getElementById('reportFrom')?.addEventListener('change',e=>{reportFrom=e.target.value;render();});document.getElementById('reportTo')?.addEventListener('change',e=>{reportTo=e.target.value;render();});document.getElementById('reportBasis')?.addEventListener('change',e=>{reportBasis=e.target.value;render();});document.getElementById('reportExport')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{const result=technicianStats(state,{personId:reportPerson,from:reportFrom,to:reportTo,basis:reportBasis});download(`technician-report-${today()}.csv`,toCsv(result.orders),'text/csv');});document.getElementById('reportExcel')?.addEventListener('click',()=>exportTechnicianExcel());document.getElementById('reportPdf')?.addEventListener('click',()=>printTechnicianReport());document.getElementById('mediaType')?.addEventListener('change',e=>{mediaType=e.target.value;mediaRecord='';render();});document.getElementById('mediaRecord')?.addEventListener('change',e=>{mediaRecord=e.target.value;render();});document.getElementById('mediaUpload')?.addEventListener('submit',uploadMedia);document.getElementById('mediaRefresh')?.addEventListener('click',refreshMedia);document.getElementById('userForm')?.addEventListener('submit',registerTechnician);document.getElementById('userForm')?.querySelector('[name=password]')?.addEventListener('input',e=>e.target.setCustomValidity(''));document.getElementById('newAccountRole')?.addEventListener('change',e=>{const technician=e.target.value==='technician',fields=document.getElementById('newTechnicianFields');fields.hidden=!technician;fields.style.display=technician?'':'none';fields.querySelector('[name=name]').required=technician;});if(view==='users')void loadRegisteredUsers();document.getElementById('cloudButton')?.addEventListener('click',()=>cloudReady?syncNow():connectCloud());document.getElementById('settingsCloud')?.addEventListener('click',()=>cloudReady?syncNow():connectCloud());document.getElementById('menuButton')?.addEventListener('click',()=>document.querySelector('.sidebar').classList.toggle('show'));document.getElementById('searchInput')?.addEventListener('input',e=>{search=e.target.value;const caret=e.target.selectionStart;render();const input=document.getElementById('searchInput');input.focus();input.setSelectionRange(caret,caret);});document.getElementById('statusFilter')?.addEventListener('change',e=>{filter=e.target.value;render();});document.querySelectorAll('[data-month]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(b.dataset.month==='0')calendarMonth=today().slice(0,7);else {const [y,m]=calendarMonth.split('-').map(Number);const next=new Date(y,m-1+Number(b.dataset.month),1);calendarMonth=today(next).slice(0,7);}render();}));document.getElementById('recordForm')?.addEventListener('submit',saveRecord);document.getElementById('deleteRecord')?.addEventListener('click',delRecord);document.querySelectorAll('[data-check]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('change',()=>{const w=state.workOrders.find(x=>x.id===modal.id);w.checklist[Number(b.dataset.check)].done=b.checked;audit(state,'Checklist updated','workOrders',w);persist();}));document.getElementById('completeOrder')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{try{const w=state.workOrders.find(x=>x.id===modal.id);w.completionNotes=document.getElementById('detailNotes').value;completeOrder(w);audit(state,'Completed','workOrders',w);persist();modal=null;banner='Work order completed and recorded.';render();}catch(err){alert(err.message);}});document.getElementById('companyForm')?.addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();try{const form=e.currentTarget,values=new FormData(form),company={};for(const [key,label,required] of COMPANY_FIELDS){company[key]=String(values.get(key)||'').trim();if(required)requireText(company[key],label);}if(company.email&&!/^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(company.email))throw Error('Enter a valid company email address');if(company.website&&!/^https?:\/\//i.test(company.website))throw Error('Website must begin with https:// or http://');if(!/^[A-Z]{3}$/.test(company.currency.toUpperCase()))throw Error('Currency must be a three-letter ISO code, for example ZAR');company.currency=company.currency.toUpperCase();state.settings.company=company;state.settings.currency=company.currency;audit(state,'Company details updated','settings',null);persist();toast('Company details saved.');}catch(error){showError(error,'Save company details');}});document.getElementById('settingsForm')?.addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();const data=new FormData(e.target);state.settings.facility=requireText(data.get('facility'),'Facility name');state.settings.siteCode=String(data.get('siteCode')||'');audit(state,'Settings updated','settings',null);persist();toast('Facility settings saved.');});document.getElementById('downloadBackup')?.addEventListener('click',()=>download(`cmms-backup-${today()}.json`,JSON.stringify(state,null,2),'application/json'));document.getElementById('importBackup')?.addEventListener('click',()=>document.getElementById('importFile').click());document.getElementById('importFile')?.addEventListener('change',async e=>{const file=e.target.files?.[0];if(!file)return;try{const restored=normalizeState(JSON.parse(await file.text()));if(!confirm('Replace ALL current CMMS data with the selected backup? This cannot be undone.'))return;state=restored;audit(state,'Restored backup','system',null);persist();toast('Backup restored.');}catch(err){alert(`Backup invalid: ${err.message}`);}});document.getElementById('seedDemo')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{if(!confirm('Replace all current records with demonstration data? Export a backup first.'))return;state=demoState();audit(state,'Loaded demo','system',null);persist();toast('Demo facility loaded.');});}
async function syncNow(){if(!cloudReady)return;clearTimeout(saveTimer);try{await puter.kv.set('cmms-state-v1',state);toast('Cloud sync completed.');}catch(e){toast(`Sync failed: ${e.message}`,true);}}
function describeError(error,context='Operation'){const status=error?.status;const message=String(error?.message||error||'Unknown error')+(error?.requestId?' (Reference: '+error.requestId+')':'');const guidance=status===400?'Check the highlighted or required fields and try again.':status===401?'Your session may have expired. Sign in again.':status===403?'Your account does not have permission for this operation.':status===404?'The requested record or service could not be found.':status===409?'The record already exists or was modified by another user. Refresh the list before retrying.':status===413?'The uploaded file or request is too large.':status===415?'This file type is not supported.':status===429?'Too many attempts. Wait before retrying.':status>=500?'The server could not complete the operation. Check the CMMS server terminal; existing data has not been confirmed saved.':error instanceof TypeError?'The server may be offline or unreachable. Check the CMMS server connection.':'';return context+': '+message+(guidance?' '+guidance:'');}
function showError(error,context='Operation',element=null){const message=describeError(error,context);console.error('[CMMS]',context,error);if(element){element.textContent=message;element.setAttribute('role','alert');}else{banner=message;render();}return message;}
window.addEventListener('unhandledrejection',event=>{event.preventDefault();showError(event.reason,'Unexpected background operation');});
window.addEventListener('error',event=>{if(event.error)showError(event.error,'Unexpected application error');});
async function api(path,options={}){let response;try{response=await fetch(path,{credentials:'same-origin',...options});}catch(error){throw Object.assign(Error('Cannot contact CMMS at '+location.origin+'. Check that the server is running and your network is available.'),{cause:error});}let data;try{data=await response.json();}catch{throw Object.assign(Error('The server returned an invalid response (HTTP '+response.status+'). Check the server terminal for details.'),{status:response.status});}if(!response.ok)throw Object.assign(Error(data.error||'Request failed'),{status:response.status,code:data.code,requestId:data.requestId});return data;}
async function initialize(){try{const r=await fetch('/api/status',{cache:'no-store'});if(!r.ok)throw Error('No backend');serverStatus=await r.json();if(!serverStatus.database){app.innerHTML=setupLanding(serverStatus.detail);return;}try{const me=await api('/api/me');currentUser=me.user;serverMode=true;await loadServer();}catch{currentUser=null;}render();}catch{render();}}
function setupLanding(message){return `<div class="auth-page"><div class="panel pad auth-box"><h1>CMMS · Database setup</h1><p>${esc(message)}</p><p>Configure the MariaDB database and the server's <code>.env</code> file, then restart <code>npm run server</code>. Never enter database passwords into a public browser.</p><a href="./USER_MANUAL.md">Open setup manual</a></div></div>`;}
function loginScreen(){return `<div class="auth-page"><section class="panel pad auth-box"><h1>CMMS · ${serverStatus.initialized?'Technician sign in':'Initial administrator setup'}</h1><p>Shared MariaDB maintenance database · registered accounts only</p><form id="loginForm">${!serverStatus.initialized?'<label>Server setup token<input name="setupToken" type="password" required autocomplete="off"></label>':''}<label>Username<input name="username" required autocomplete="username" minlength="3"></label><label>Password<input name="password" type="password" required minlength="12" autocomplete="${serverStatus.initialized?'current-password':'new-password'}"></label><button class="btn primary" type="submit">${serverStatus.initialized?'Sign in':'Create first administrator'}</button></form><p class="fine-print">${serverStatus.initialized?'Accounts are created by the administrator.':'The setup token is configured in .env on the server. Use a strong password.'}</p><p id="loginError" class="error-text"></p></section></div>`;}
function wireLogin(){document.getElementById('loginForm')?.addEventListener('submit',async e=>{e.preventDefault();const x=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(e.currentTarget));const el=document.getElementById('loginError');try{if(!serverStatus.initialized){await api('/api/bootstrap',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(x)});serverStatus.initialized=true;}const r=await api('/api/login',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(x)});currentUser=r.user;serverMode=true;await loadServer();view='dashboard';render();}catch(err){showError(err,'Sign in',el);}});}
async function loadServer(){const r=await api('/api/state');state=normalizeState(r.state);serverRevision=r.revision;}
let pendingServerSave=Promise.resolve();
async function saveServer(strict=false){const snapshot=structuredClone(state);pendingServerSave=pendingServerSave.then(async()=>{try{const revision=serverRevision;const result=await api('/api/state',{method:'PUT',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({revision,state:snapshot})});serverRevision=result.revision;}catch(e){banner=`Database save failed: ${e.message}. Changes may not be saved. Export a backup and reload before further edits.`;render();if(strict)throw e;}});return pendingServerSave;}
function printAssetLabel(id){const asset=state.assets.find(a=>a.id===id);if(!asset){showError(Error('Asset not found. Refresh the asset register.'),'Print asset label');return;}const loc=state.locations.find(l=>l.id===asset.locationId);let svg;try{svg=qrSvg(assetPayload(asset,loc,state.settings.facility),4);}catch(error){showError(error,'Generate asset QR label');return;}const fields=Object.entries(asset).filter(([key,value])=>value!==''&&value!=null&&key!=='id').map(([key,value])=>'<tr><th>'+esc(key.replace(/[A-Z]/g,m=>' '+m))+'</th><td>'+esc(String(value))+'</td></tr>').join('');const html='<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Asset QR label '+esc(asset.code||'')+'</title><style>body{font:12px Arial,sans-serif;color:#111;max-width:750px;margin:25px auto}.label{border:2px solid #111;padding:16px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px}.label svg{width:220px;height:220px;flex:none}.label h1{font-size:21px}.label p{margin:6px 0}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;margin-top:20px}th,td{border:1px solid #aaa;padding:7px;text-align:left}th{width:30%}button{padding:9px 15px}@media print{.no-print{display:none}body{margin:0;max-width:none}@page{size:A4;margin:15mm}}</style></head><body><div class="label">'+svg+'<div><small>'+esc(state.settings.facility||'Facility')+'</small><h1>'+esc(asset.code||'ASSET')+'</h1><strong>'+esc(asset.name||'')+'</strong><p>'+esc(loc?.name||'')+'</p><p>Scan QR for the full asset record (offline)</p></div></div><h2>Asset register details</h2><table>'+fields+'</table><p class="no-print"><button onclick="window.print()">Print label / Save as PDF</button></p></body></html>';const tab=window.open('','_blank');if(!tab){showError(Error('Your browser blocked the label window. Allow pop-ups for this CMMS address.'),'Print asset label');return;}tab.document.open();tab.document.write(html);tab.document.close();tab.focus();}
function printWorkOrder(id,existingTab=null){const w=state.workOrders.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!w){showError(Error('Work order not found. Refresh the work-order list.'),'Print work order');return;}const asset=state.assets.find(x=>x.id===w.assetId);const loc=state.locations.find(x=>x.id===w.locationId);const person=state.people.find(x=>x.id===w.assigneeId);const fields=[['Work order number',w.code],['Status',w.status],['Priority',w.priority],['Work type',w.type],['Asset',asset?.name||asset?.code||'Not specified'],['Location',loc?.name||'Not specified'],['Assigned technician',person?.name||'Unassigned'],['Due date',w.dueDate||'Not specified'],['Created',w.createdAt?.slice(0,10)||'Not recorded'],['Completed',w.completedAt?.slice(0,10)||'Not completed'],['Labour hours',w.laborHours??0],['Material cost estimate (ZAR)',w.materialCost??0],['Actual posted cost (ZAR)',costReport(state).byWorkOrder.find(g=>g.workOrder===w.code)?.total?.toFixed(2)||'0.00']];const rows=fields.map(([key,value])=>'<tr><th>'+esc(key)+'</th><td>'+esc(String(value??''))+'</td></tr>').join('');let qrMarkup;try{qrMarkup=qrSvg(workOrderPayload(w,asset,loc,person,state.settings.facility),3);}catch(error){showError(error,'Generate work-order QR code');existingTab?.close();return;}const checks=(w.checklist||[]).map(x=>'<li>'+(x.done?'☑ ':'☐ ')+esc(x.label)+'</li>').join('');const html='<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Work order '+esc(w.code||'')+'</title><style>body{font:12px Arial,sans-serif;color:#161616;max-width:850px;margin:28px auto}header{border-bottom:3px solid #222;padding-bottom:12px}.company-print{padding:8px 0 14px;font-size:11px}.company-print strong{font-size:18px}.company-print div{margin-top:3px}h1{font-size:24px;margin:8px 0}h2{font-size:15px;margin-top:22px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}th,td{border:1px solid #bbb;padding:7px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}th{width:32%;background:#f0f0f0}section{white-space:pre-wrap;min-height:45px;border:1px solid #ccc;padding:10px}footer{margin-top:28px;border-top:1px solid #777;padding-top:15px}.qr-block{float:right;text-align:center;margin:8px 0 12px 18px;max-width:170px}.qr-block svg{width:150px;height:150px}.qr-block small{display:block;font-size:9px}ul{padding-left:20px}button{padding:9px 15px}@media print{.no-print{display:none}body{margin:0;max-width:none}@page{size:A4;margin:15mm}}</style></head><body><header>'+companyHeader()+'<small>'+esc(state.settings.facility||'Facility')+' · Maintenance department</small><h1>WORK ORDER</h1><strong>'+esc(w.code||'')+' — '+esc(w.title||'')+'</strong></header><div class="qr-block">'+qrMarkup+'<small>Scan for work-order identification</small></div><h2>Work order details</h2><table>'+rows+'</table><h2>Instructions / fault description</h2><section>'+esc(w.description||'No instructions recorded')+'</section><h2>Maintenance checklist</h2>'+(checks?'<ul>'+checks+'</ul>':'<p>No checklist recorded</p>')+'<h2>Work performed / findings</h2><section>'+esc(w.completionNotes||'Not yet recorded')+'</section><footer>Technician signature: ____________________ &nbsp;&nbsp; Date: ______________<p>Supervisor verification: ____________________ &nbsp;&nbsp; Date: ______________</p><small>Generated from CMMS. A printed copy is not a digital approval or statutory certificate.</small></footer><p class="no-print"><button onclick="window.print()">Print / Save as PDF</button></p></body></html>';const tab=existingTab||window.open('','_blank');if(!tab){showError(Error('Your browser blocked the print window. Allow pop-ups for '+location.origin+' and try again.'),'Print work order');return;}tab.document.open();tab.document.write(html);tab.document.close();tab.focus();}
function reportRows(){const result=technicianStats(state,{personId:reportPerson,from:reportFrom,to:reportTo,basis:reportBasis});const names=new Map(state.people.map(p=>[p.id,p.name]));return result.orders.map(w=>({'Work order':w.code||'',Title:w.title||'',Technician:names.get(w.assigneeId)||'Unassigned',Type:w.type||'',Status:w.status||'',Priority:w.priority||'','Created date':(w.createdAt||'').slice(0,10),'Completed date':(w.completedAt||'').slice(0,10),'Due date':w.dueDate||'','Labour hours':Number(w.laborHours)||0,'Material cost ZAR':Number(w.materialCost)||0}));}
function xmlSafe(value){return String(value??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,c=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&apos;'}[c])).replace(/[\\u0000-\\u0008\\u000B\\u000C\\u000E-\\u001F]/g,'');}
function exportTechnicianExcel(){const rows=reportRows();const columns=['Work order','Title','Technician','Type','Status','Priority','Created date','Completed date','Due date','Labour hours','Material cost ZAR'];const cell=(value)=>{const numeric=typeof value==='number'&&Number.isFinite(value);return '<Cell><Data ss:Type="'+(numeric?'Number':'String')+'">'+xmlSafe(value)+'</Data></Cell>';};const table='<Row>'+columns.map(cell).join('')+'</Row>'+rows.map(r=>'<Row>'+columns.map(k=>cell(r[k])).join('')+'</Row>').join('');const xml='<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><?mso-application progid="Excel.Sheet"?><Workbook xmlns="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:spreadsheet" xmlns:ss="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:spreadsheet"><Worksheet ss:Name="Technician report"><Table>'+table+'</Table></Worksheet></Workbook>';download('technician-report-'+today()+'.xml',xml,'application/xml;charset=utf-8');}
function printTechnicianReport(){const rows=reportRows();const columns=['Work order','Title','Technician','Type','Status','Priority','Created date','Completed date','Due date','Labour hours','Material cost ZAR'];const selected=state.people.find(p=>p.id===reportPerson)?.name||'All technicians';const title='CMMS technician report';const printWindow=window.open('','_blank');if(!printWindow){alert('Allow pop-ups to print this report as PDF.');return;}const table='<table><thead><tr>'+columns.map(k=>'<th>'+esc(k)+'</th>').join('')+'</tr></thead><tbody>'+rows.map(r=>'<tr>'+columns.map(k=>'<td>'+esc(String(r[k]??''))+'</td>').join('')+'</tr>').join('')+'</tbody></table>';printWindow.document.open();printWindow.document.write('<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>'+title+'</title><style>body{font:11px Arial,sans-serif;margin:20px;color:#111}h1{font-size:20px}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%}td,th{border:1px solid #888;padding:5px;text-align:left;overflow-wrap:anywhere}th{background:#ddd}@page{size:landscape;margin:12mm}</style></head><body><h1>'+title+'</h1><p>Technician: '+esc(selected)+' | Basis: '+esc(reportBasis)+' | From: '+esc(reportFrom||'All')+' | To: '+esc(reportTo||'All')+' | Orders: '+rows.length+'</p>'+table+'</body></html>');printWindow.document.close();printWindow.focus();printWindow.print();}
function technicianReportView(){const r=technicianStats(state,{personId:reportPerson,from:reportFrom,to:reportTo,basis:reportBasis});return `<section class="panel pad"><h2>Technician performance</h2><p>Filter by technician and the date work was assigned or completed. Assigned means work-order creation date; completed means actual completion date.</p><div class="filter-row"><label>Technician<select id="reportPerson"><option value="">All technicians</option>${state.people.map(p=>`<option value="${esc(p.id)}" ${reportPerson===p.id?'selected':''}>${esc(p.name)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label>Date basis<select id="reportBasis"><option value="completed" ${reportBasis==='completed'?'selected':''}>Completed</option><option value="assigned" ${reportBasis==='assigned'?'selected':''}>Assigned / created</option></select></label><label>From<input id="reportFrom" type="date" value="${esc(reportFrom)}"></label><label>To<input id="reportTo" type="date" value="${esc(reportTo)}"></label><button class="btn outline" id="reportExport">CSV</button><button class="btn outline" id="reportExcel">Excel (.xml)</button><button class="btn outline" id="reportPdf">Print / Save PDF</button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Technician</th><th>Orders</th><th>Completed</th><th>Open</th><th>PM</th><th>Corrective</th><th>Labour h</th><th>Material R</th></tr></thead><tbody>${r.rows.map(x=>`<tr><td>${esc(x.technician)}</td><td>${x.assigned}</td><td>${x.completed}</td><td>${x.open}</td><td>${x.preventive}</td><td>${x.corrective}</td><td>${x.hours.toFixed(1)}</td><td>${x.materialCost.toFixed(2)}</td></tr>`).join('')||'<tr><td colspan="8">No matching records</td></tr>'}</tbody></table></div></section>`;}
const COMPANY_FIELDS=[['name','Registered company name',true],['tradingName','Trading name'],['registration','Company registration number'],['taxNumber','VAT / tax registration number'],['address1','Street address'],['address2','Address line 2'],['city','City / town'],['province','Province / state'],['postalCode','Postal / ZIP code'],['country','Country'],['phone','Telephone'],['email','Company email'],['website','Website'],['currency','Currency (ISO 4217)'],['contact','Contact person'],['footer','Document footer / disclaimer']];
function companyData(){return state.settings.company||{};}
function companyName(){const c=companyData();return c.name||c.tradingName||state.settings.facility||'Company not configured';}
function companyHeader(){const c=companyData();return '<div class="company-print"><strong>'+esc(companyName())+'</strong>'+(c.tradingName&&c.tradingName!==c.name?'<div>T/A '+esc(c.tradingName)+'</div>':'')+'<div>'+esc([c.address1,c.address2,c.city,c.province,c.postalCode,c.country].filter(Boolean).join(', '))+'</div><div>'+esc([c.phone,c.email,c.website].filter(Boolean).join(' · '))+'</div><div>'+esc([c.registration?'Reg: '+c.registration:'',c.taxNumber?'Tax/VAT: '+c.taxNumber:''].filter(Boolean).join(' · '))+'</div></div>';}
function companyView(){const c=companyData();return heading('Company details','Registered business details for official CMMS documentation and staff identification.')+'<section class="panel pad"><h2>Company profile</h2><form id="companyForm"><div class="form-grid">'+COMPANY_FIELDS.map(([key,label,required])=>'<label>'+esc(label)+'<input name="'+key+'" '+(required?'required ':'')+'value="'+esc(c[key]|| (key==='currency'?'ZAR':key==='country'?'South Africa':''))+'"></label>').join('')+'</div><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Save company details</button></form><p class="fine-print">Company details appear on printed work orders and technician ID cards. Changes apply to newly printed documents. Tax details are informational, not tax validation.</p></section>';}
function technicianCardPayload(p){return JSON.stringify({kind:'CMMS_TECHNICIAN_ID',version:1,company:companyName(),employeeId:p.id,employeeNumber:p.employeeNumber||'',name:p.name||'',jobTitle:p.jobTitle||'',department:p.department||'',trade:p.trade||''});}
async function printTechnicianCard(id){let accounts;try{accounts=await api('/api/users');}catch(error){showError(error,'Load technician');return;}const account=accounts.users.find(x=>x.id===id&&x.role==='technician');const p=state.people.find(x=>x.id===account?.personId);if(!p){showError(Error('Technician not found'),'Print ID card');return;}const tab=window.open('','_blank');if(!tab){showError(Error('Allow pop-ups for CMMS to print technician cards'),'Print ID card');return;}tab.document.write('<title>Preparing ID card</title><p>Preparing ID card…</p>');try{const qr=qrSvg(technicianCardPayload(p),2);let photo='';if(serverMode){const response=await fetch('/api/technician-photo/'+encodeURIComponent(id),{credentials:'same-origin',cache:'no-store'});if(response.ok){const blob=await response.blob();photo=await new Promise((resolve,reject)=>{const reader=new FileReader();reader.onload=()=>resolve(reader.result);reader.onerror=()=>reject(Error('Unable to load technician photo'));reader.readAsDataURL(blob);});}}const c=companyData();const html='<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>ID card - '+esc(p.name)+'</title><style>*{box-sizing:border-box}body{font:11px Arial,sans-serif;color:#15263b;margin:15mm}.cards{display:flex;gap:12mm;flex-wrap:wrap}.card{width:85.6mm;height:54mm;border:1px solid #8e9ba8;border-radius:3mm;overflow:hidden;position:relative;background:white;break-inside:avoid}.head{background:#183d69;color:#fff;padding:3mm 4mm;height:13mm}.head strong{font-size:12px}.head small{display:block;font-size:8px}.content{display:flex;gap:3mm;padding:3mm 4mm}.portrait{width:22mm;height:27mm;object-fit:cover;border:1px solid #aaa;background:#e9eef4}.details{font-size:9px;flex:1;overflow:hidden}.details strong{display:block;font-size:12px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.details p{margin:2mm 0}.qr{width:24mm;height:24mm}.qr svg{width:100%;height:100%}.back{padding:4mm;text-align:center}.back h3{font-size:11px;margin:1mm}.back small{font-size:7px}.foot{position:absolute;bottom:2mm;left:4mm;right:4mm;font-size:7px;border-top:1px solid #bbb;padding-top:1mm}.no-print{margin-top:15px}@page{size:A4;margin:12mm}@media print{body{margin:0}.no-print{display:none}.card{border:1px solid #999}print-color-adjust:exact;-webkit-print-color-adjust:exact}</style></head><body><div class="cards"><div class="card"><div class="head"><strong>'+esc(companyName())+'</strong><small>EMPLOYEE IDENTIFICATION</small></div><div class="content">'+(photo?'<img class="portrait" src="'+photo+'">':'<div class="portrait">Photo not uploaded</div>')+'<div class="details"><strong>'+esc(p.name||'')+'</strong><p>'+esc(p.jobTitle||p.trade||'Technician')+'</p><p>Employee no: '+esc(p.employeeNumber||'Not set')+'</p><p>'+esc(p.department||'')+'</p></div></div><div class="foot">This card remains company property</div></div><div class="card back"><h3>'+esc(companyName())+'</h3><div class="qr">'+qr+'</div><p>Scan to identify employee</p><small>'+esc([c.phone,c.email,c.website].filter(Boolean).join(' · '))+'</small><div class="foot">If found, return to the issuing company. QR does not grant system access.</div></div></div><p class="no-print"><button onclick="window.print()">Print both sides / Save as PDF</button> · ISO/IEC 7810 ID-1 size: 85.60 × 53.98 mm. Print at 100% (no scaling), duplex or cut and laminate.</p></body></html>';tab.document.open();tab.document.write(html);tab.document.close();tab.focus();}catch(error){tab.close();showError(error,'Print ID card');}}
function auditView(){return heading('Audit trail & controls','Administrator-only transaction history and category settings.')+'<section class="panel pad"><h2>Audit categories</h2><div id="auditSettings">Loading…</div><p class="fine-print">Approval, stock issue, goods receipt, permission and audit-setting events are mandatory.</p></section><section class="panel pad"><h2>Recent audit events</h2><div id="auditResults">Loading…</div></section>';}
async function loadAudit(){if(view!=='audit')return;try{const [settings,events]=await Promise.all([api('/api/audit/settings'),api('/api/audit/events')]);const a=document.getElementById('auditSettings'),b=document.getElementById('auditResults');if(!a||!b)return;a.innerHTML=AUDIT_CATEGORIES.map(category=>'<label style="display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin:10px"><input type="checkbox" data-audit-category="'+esc(category)+'" '+(settings.settings[category]?'checked':'')+'>'+esc(category)+'</label>').join('');a.querySelectorAll('[data-audit-category]').forEach(box=>box.addEventListener('change',async()=>{try{await api('/api/audit/settings',{method:'PATCH',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({category:box.dataset.auditCategory,enabled:box.checked})});await loadAudit();}catch(error){showError(error,'Audit settings');}}));b.innerHTML='<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Time</th><th>Actor</th><th>Category</th><th>Action</th><th>Record</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+events.events.map(e=>'<tr><td>'+esc(e.occurredAt)+'</td><td>'+esc(e.actor)+'</td><td>'+esc(e.category)+'</td><td>'+esc(e.action)+'</td><td>'+esc(e.entityId)+'</td></tr>').join('')+'</tbody></table></div>';}catch(error){showError(error,'Audit trail');}}
function setupView(){return heading('System setup','MariaDB connection, storage and access controls.')+`<section class="panel pad"><h2>Database connection</h2><p>${serverMode?'MariaDB connected. Shared state is stored with revision checks.':'Currently running in Puter single-account mode.'}</p><p>Database credentials are configured on the server using <code>.env</code>; they are never exposed to the browser. Start the server using <code>npm run server</code> and open port 3001.</p><p>Media folder: server-managed, private, configured with <code>CMMS_MEDIA_DIR</code>. Uploaded files are available only after login.</p><p>For production, use HTTPS, a dedicated database user, scheduled MariaDB and media backups, and an approved restore procedure.</p><a href="./USER_MANUAL.md" target="_blank">Detailed setup instructions</a></section>`;}
function usersView(){return heading('Registered technicians','Register technicians once, maintain employee details and print ID cards.')+`<section class="panel pad"><h2>Register technician or administrator</h2><form id="userForm" class="form-grid"><label>Username<input name="username" required minlength="3" maxlength="48" autocomplete="off"></label><label>Temporary password (12–128 characters)<input name="password" type="password" required minlength="12" maxlength="128" autocomplete="new-password"></label><label>Role<select name="role" id="newAccountRole"><option value="technician">Technician</option><option value="admin">Administrator</option></select></label><div id="newTechnicianFields" class="form-grid" style="grid-column:1/-1"><label>Full name<input name="name" required></label><label>Employee number<input name="employeeNumber"></label><label>Trade / discipline<input name="trade"></label><label>Job title<input name="jobTitle"></label><label>Department<input name="department"></label><label>Email<input name="email" type="email"></label><label>Cellphone<input name="cellphone" type="tel"></label></div><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Register account and employee</button></form><p class="fine-print">Technicians are registered once: their employee record is created and linked automatically. Use Employee details afterward to add optional information.</p><h2>Technician directory</h2><div id="userResults">Loading registered accounts...</div></section>`;}

let editingAccountId='';
async function loadRegisteredUsers(){
 const target=document.getElementById('userResults');if(!target||!serverMode)return;
 try{
  const response=await api('/api/users');if(!target.isConnected)return;
  const people=new Map(state.people.map(p=>[p.id,p]));
  const options=selected=>'<option value="">Not linked</option>'+state.people.map(p=>'<option value="'+esc(p.id)+'" '+(selected===p.id?'selected':'')+'>'+esc(p.name)+'</option>').join('');
  const linkedCounts=new Map();for(const user of response.users)if(user.role==='technician'&&user.personId)linkedCounts.set(user.personId,(linkedCounts.get(user.personId)||0)+1);
  const rows=response.users.map(u=>{
   const p=people.get(u.personId);const shared=p&&linkedCounts.get(p.id)>1;
   return '<tr><td>'+(p?'<img src="/api/technician-photo/'+encodeURIComponent(u.id)+'" alt="" loading="lazy" style="width:36px;height:42px;object-fit:cover;vertical-align:middle;margin-right:8px" onerror="this.style.display=\'none\'">':'')+'<strong>'+esc(p?.name||u.username)+'</strong>'+(shared?'<br><small style="color:#ffbd70">Shared employee record — separate</small>':'')+'<br><small>'+esc(u.username)+'</small></td><td>'+esc(p?.employeeNumber||'—')+'</td><td>'+esc(p?.trade||'—')+'</td><td>'+esc(p?.email||'—')+'</td><td>'+esc(p?.cellphone||p?.phone||'—')+'</td><td>'+esc(u.role)+'</td><td>'+(u.active?'Active':'Disabled')+'</td><td><button class="btn outline" type="button" data-account-edit="'+esc(u.id)+'">Edit</button> '+(u.role==='technician'?'<button class="btn outline" type="button" data-account-permissions="'+esc(u.id)+'">Permissions</button> ':'')+(p?'<button class="btn outline" type="button" data-person-edit="'+esc(p.id)+'">Employee details</button> '+(shared?'<button class="btn outline" type="button" data-separate-account="'+esc(u.id)+'" data-account-name="'+esc(u.username)+'">Separate employee</button> ':'')+'<button class="btn outline" type="button" data-photo-upload="'+esc(u.id)+'">Upload photo</button> <button class="btn outline" type="button" data-print-id="'+esc(u.id)+'">Print ID card</button>':'<button class="btn outline" type="button" data-person-new="1">Add employee</button>')+' <button class="btn outline" type="button" data-account-status="'+esc(u.id)+'" data-active="'+(u.active?0:1)+'">'+(u.active?'Disable':'Enable')+'</button></td></tr>';
  }).join('');
  target.innerHTML=(Array.from(linkedCounts.values()).some(n=>n>1)?'<p role="alert" style="color:#ffbd70;font-weight:600">Some older accounts share an employee record. Click Separate employee to create and link a distinct employee automatically. The original record and photo are preserved.</p>':'')+'<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Technician / username</th><th>Employee no.</th><th>Trade</th><th>Email</th><th>Cellphone</th><th>Role</th><th>Status</th><th>Actions</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+(rows||'<tr><td colspan="8">No registered accounts</td></tr>')+'</tbody></table></div>';
  const u=response.users.find(x=>x.id===editingAccountId);
  if(u)target.insertAdjacentHTML('beforeend','<section class="panel pad"><h3>Edit login: '+esc(u.username)+'</h3><form id="accountEditForm" data-user-id="'+esc(u.id)+'"><div class="filter-row"><label>Username<input name="username" required minlength="3" maxlength="48" value="'+esc(u.username)+'"></label><label>Role<select name="role"><option value="technician" '+(u.role==='technician'?'selected':'')+'>Technician</option><option value="admin" '+(u.role==='admin'?'selected':'')+'>Administrator</option></select></label><label>Linked employee<select name="personId">'+options(u.personId)+'</select></label><label><input type="checkbox" id="changeAccountPassword"> Change password</label><label>New password (12–128 characters)<input name="password" id="accountNewPassword" type="password" minlength="12" maxlength="128" autocomplete="off" disabled placeholder="Enable change password first"></label></div><button class="btn primary" type="submit">Save changes</button> <button class="btn outline" type="button" id="cancelAccountEdit">Cancel</button></form></section>');
  target.querySelectorAll('[data-account-permissions]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const u=response.users.find(x=>x.id===button.dataset.accountPermissions);if(!u)return;const container=document.createElement('section');container.className='panel pad';container.innerHTML='<h3>Permissions — '+esc(u.username)+'</h3><form id="capabilityForm">'+CAPABILITIES.map(key=>'<label style="display:block;padding:6px"><input type="checkbox" name="'+key+'" '+(u.permissions?.[key]?'checked':'')+'> '+esc(CAPABILITY_LABELS[key])+'</label>').join('')+'<button class="btn primary">Save permissions</button> <button class="btn outline" type="button" id="cancelCapabilities">Cancel</button></form>';target.prepend(container);container.querySelector('#cancelCapabilities').onclick=()=>container.remove();container.querySelector('form').onsubmit=async e=>{e.preventDefault();const permissions=Object.fromEntries(CAPABILITIES.map(key=>[key,e.currentTarget.elements[key].checked]));try{await api('/api/permissions',{method:'PATCH',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({id:u.id,permissions})});toast('Permissions updated. Technician must sign in again.');await loadRegisteredUsers();}catch(error){showError(error,'Permissions');}};}));target.querySelectorAll('[data-account-edit]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{editingAccountId=button.dataset.accountEdit;void loadRegisteredUsers();}));
  target.querySelectorAll('[data-separate-account]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',async()=>{const username=button.dataset.accountName;const name=prompt('Full name for technician '+username+':',username);if(!name?.trim())return;try{await api('/api/users/separate',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({id:button.dataset.separateAccount,name:name.trim()})});await loadServer();render();toast('Employee identity separated. Upload the correct photograph.');}catch(error){showError(error,'Separate employee record');}}));
  target.querySelectorAll('[data-print-id]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>printTechnicianCard(button.dataset.printId)));target.querySelectorAll('[data-photo-upload]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>{const id=button.dataset.photoUpload;const input=document.createElement('input');input.type='file';input.accept='image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp';input.addEventListener('change',async()=>{const file=input.files?.[0];if(!file)return;if(!['image/jpeg','image/png','image/webp'].includes(file.type)){showError(Error('Choose a JPEG, PNG or WebP photograph'),'Upload technician photo');return;}if(file.size>2*1024*1024){showError(Error('Photograph exceeds 2 MB. Resize or compress it before uploading.'),'Upload technician photo');return;}try{await api('/api/technician-photo/'+encodeURIComponent(id),{method:'PUT',headers:{'Content-Type':file.type},body:file});toast('Technician photograph saved.');await loadRegisteredUsers();}catch(error){showError(error,'Upload technician photo');}});input.click();}));
  target.querySelectorAll('[data-person-edit]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>openNew('people',button.dataset.personEdit)));
  target.querySelectorAll('[data-person-new]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',()=>openNew('people')));
  target.querySelectorAll('[data-account-status]').forEach(button=>button.addEventListener('click',toggleRegisteredUser));
  target.querySelector('#accountEditForm')?.addEventListener('submit',updateRegisteredUser);target.querySelector('#changeAccountPassword')?.addEventListener('change',e=>{const input=target.querySelector('#accountNewPassword');input.disabled=!e.target.checked;input.required=e.target.checked;if(!e.target.checked)input.value='';});
  target.querySelector('#cancelAccountEdit')?.addEventListener('click',()=>{editingAccountId='';void loadRegisteredUsers();});
 }catch(error){if(target.isConnected)target.textContent='Could not load accounts: '+error.message;}
}
async function updateRegisteredUser(e){e.preventDefault();const form=e.currentTarget;const values=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form));values.id=form.dataset.userId;const changePassword=form.querySelector('#changeAccountPassword')?.checked;if(!changePassword)delete values.password;else if(!values.password||values.password.length<12||values.password.length>128){showError(Error('Password must be between 12 and 128 characters. Uncheck Change password to keep the current password.'),'Edit login');return;}try{await api('/api/users',{method:'PATCH',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(values)});editingAccountId='';toast('Account updated.');await loadRegisteredUsers();}catch(error){showError(error,'Edit technician login');}}
async function toggleRegisteredUser(e){const button=e.currentTarget;const active=button.dataset.active==='1';if(!confirm((active?'Enable':'Disable')+' this account?'))return;try{await api('/api/users/status',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({id:button.dataset.accountStatus,active})});toast('Account status updated.');await loadRegisteredUsers();}catch(error){showError(error,'Change account status');}}

async function registerTechnician(e){e.preventDefault();const form=e.currentTarget;const values=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(form));if(values.password.length<12){form.querySelector('[name=password]').setCustomValidity('Enter at least 12 characters for a new login.');form.reportValidity();return;}form.querySelector('[name=password]').setCustomValidity('');try{await api('/api/users',{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify(values)});await loadServer();render();toast('Account and employee registered.');}catch(error){showError(error,'Register technician');await loadRegisteredUsers();}}
let mediaList=[];
function mediaView(){const rows=state[mediaType]||[];if(!mediaRecord&&rows.length)mediaRecord=rows[0].id;return heading('Asset & compliance documents','Upload PDFs, photos and supporting records into protected server media storage.')+`<section class="panel pad"><div class="filter-row"><label>Record type<select id="mediaType"><option value="assets" ${mediaType==='assets'?'selected':''}>Assets</option><option value="inspections" ${mediaType==='inspections'?'selected':''}>Compliance</option></select></label><label>Linked record<select id="mediaRecord">${rows.map(x=>`<option value="${esc(x.id)}" ${mediaRecord===x.id?'selected':''}>${esc(x.name||x.title||x.code)}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><button class="btn outline" id="mediaRefresh">Refresh files</button></div><form id="mediaUpload" class="filter-row"><label>Upload document<input name="file" type="file" accept=".pdf,.png,.jpg,.jpeg,.webp,.txt" required></label><button class="btn primary" type="submit" ${!serverMode||!mediaRecord?'disabled':''}>Upload file</button></form><p class="fine-print">Supported: PDF, PNG, JPEG, WebP and TXT; default maximum 15 MB. Files are stored on the server, not in Git or Puter. Uploads require administrator access.</p><div id="mediaResults">Select a record and refresh to view files.</div></section>`;}
async function refreshMedia(){const el=document.getElementById('mediaResults');if(!el||!mediaRecord)return;try{const r=await api(`/api/files?type=${encodeURIComponent(mediaType)}&id=${encodeURIComponent(mediaRecord)}`);mediaList=r.files;el.innerHTML=mediaList.length?`<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>File</th><th>Size</th><th>Uploaded</th><th>Action</th></tr></thead><tbody>${mediaList.map(f=>`<tr><td>${esc(f.name)}</td><td>${Math.ceil(f.size/1024)} KB</td><td>${esc(String(f.createdAt).slice(0,10))}</td><td><a href="/api/files/${encodeURIComponent(f.id)}">Download</a> <button class="text-button" data-remove-file="${esc(f.id)}">Delete</button></td></tr>`).join('')}</tbody></table></div>`:'No documents uploaded for this record.';el.querySelectorAll('[data-remove-file]').forEach(b=>b.addEventListener('click',async()=>{if(!confirm('Delete this file permanently?'))return;try{await api('/api/files/'+b.dataset.removeFile,{method:'DELETE'});refreshMedia();}catch(e){alert(e.message);}}));}catch(e){el.textContent=e.message;}}
async function uploadMedia(e){e.preventDefault();const file=new FormData(e.currentTarget).get('file');if(!(file instanceof File)||!file.size)return;try{await api(`/api/files?type=${encodeURIComponent(mediaType)}&id=${encodeURIComponent(mediaRecord)}&name=${encodeURIComponent(file.name)}`,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':file.type||'application/octet-stream'},body:file});e.currentTarget.reset();await refreshMedia();}catch(e){alert(e.message);}}

initialize();